<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>硬件 on Ian's Blog</title><link>http://example.org/docs/programmer/hardware/</link><description>Recent content in 硬件 on Ian's Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="http://example.org/docs/programmer/hardware/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title/><link>http://example.org/docs/programmer/hardware/raspberrypi/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://example.org/docs/programmer/hardware/raspberrypi/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="树莓派"&gt;树莓派&lt;a class="anchor" href="#%e6%a0%91%e8%8e%93%e6%b4%be"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2 id="详细文档"&gt;详细文档&lt;a class="anchor" href="#%e8%af%a6%e7%bb%86%e6%96%87%e6%a1%a3"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;参考&lt;a href="https://cloud-atlas.readthedocs.io/zh_CN/latest/arm/raspberry_pi/hardware/pi_4.html"&gt;Cloud Atlas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;很详细的罗列了树莓派各个版本的参数以及IO&amp;amp;其他参数的汇总，属于对官方文档的翻译以及补充，基于实践的补充，很有用。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>http://example.org/docs/programmer/hardware/screen/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://example.org/docs/programmer/hardware/screen/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="便携屏幕"&gt;便携屏幕&lt;a class="anchor" href="#%e4%be%bf%e6%90%ba%e5%b1%8f%e5%b9%95"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;某日入得4K便携屏幕一个, 甚是欢喜。无论手机、NS、PC用之皆爽.然NS &lt;code&gt;1080P&lt;/code&gt; 缩放至 &lt;code&gt;4k&lt;/code&gt; 略糊，只可远观。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;某日因压了个键盘和书，搬，屏幕裂，屏花之。方知平时屏幕擦灰时，稍加用力就会破碎感不是虚妄，而是确实。可见质量甚是不行，弃。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>